  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CCJP -  Strengthening Civil Society Engagement and Participation in Zimbabwe</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Interventions of the Commission are largely community based at the micro level as they cover the whole Diocese (Manicaland Province). This partnership seeks to address human rights violations particularly focusing on peacebuilding and politically motivated violence. The project will have an advocacy component where issues from the micro level will be directed for action by duty bearers. CCJP has established good relations with various stakeholders in the district and also takes issues to the national level through the national CCJP Office.</narrative>
  </description>
